  headliner: <b>Judge In Copper Scam Case Admits He Was Also Scammed</b>
  bodyText: 'Courtroom proceedings in New Manila took a bizarre, viral turn this
    morning during the fraud and property-damage trial involving notorious metal
    merchant Mr. Nasir and outraged buyer Nanni, after the presiding judge casually
    revealed from the bench that he had once been scammed by Nasir himself '
